The package ck provides CMake targets:

    find_package(unofficial-ck CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::ck::ck)

Or with pkg-config:

    find_package(PkgConfig REQUIRED)
    pkg_check_modules(CK REQUIRED IMPORTED_TARGET ck)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE PkgConfig::CK)
    